#: includes/class-wc-b2b-order-manager.php
msgid "Payment Reminder 💰\n\nHello %s!\n\nYour order #%s is still awaiting payment.\n\n⚠️ Important: Your order will be cancelled in %d days if payment is not received.\n\nOrder Total: %s\n\nPay now: %s\n\nIf you have already paid or have questions, please contact us immediately."
msgstr "付款提醒 💰\n\n您好 %s！\n\n您的订单 #%s 仍在等待付款。\n\n⚠️ 重要：如果未收到付款，您的订单将在 %d 天后取消。\n\n订单总计：%s\n\n立即付款：%s\n\n如果您已经付款或有疑问，请立即联系我们。"

msgid "Order Cancelled ❌\n\nHello %s,\n\nWe regret to inform you that your order #%s has been cancelled due to non-payment within the specified time period.\n\nOrder Total: %s\n\nIf you are still interested in these products, please feel free to place a new order or contact us directly.\n\nThank you for your understanding."
msgstr "订单已取消 ❌\n\n您好 %s，\n\n我们很遗憾地通知您，您的订单 #%s 因在指定时间内未付款而被取消。\n\n订单总计：%s\n\n如果您仍对这些产品感兴趣，请随时下新订单或直接联系我们。\n\n感谢您的理解。"

